WEBVTT

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.040
She gave me a truly precious gift.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.410
I can go out. I'm done being a recluse.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.740
This is the starting line of my life.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.740
I can finally get going.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.910
Okay!

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.700
Hey!

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.990
Oh! Honestly!

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.290
Father, Mother.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:48.950
May I go play outside?

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.990
Outside? S-Sure. Of course.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:54.580
Dear! Rudy is going out on his own!

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:59.240
And I used to worry he might
be sickly. Time really flies.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.660
It does.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.330
Were you worried about that?

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.990
Well, you never cried at all.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:09.830
Really? I'm growing into a sturdy, charming son.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:14.830
Those ways you don't act
like a kid make me worry more.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:17.990
Don't you want your
eldest son to be levelheaded?

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.540
No, I've got no complaints, but...

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:26.410
You could always tell me to become
more worthy of the Greyrat legacy.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:30.410
If that's what you want,
bring home a girlfriend or two.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:31.700
Understood.

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.870
I'll look for a woman who's a match for mother.

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.790
My!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.620
Oh, and be nice to people.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.740
A man's strength isn't
for pushing people around.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.410
I know, Father.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.410
A man's strength is for
showing off to girls, right?

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.240
Right.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.120
Oh, no! That's not right.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.580
I'm kidding.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.160
It's for protecting the weak, right?

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:00.370
Y-Yeah, that's right.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.950
Well then, I'm going!

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.490
Take care!

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:09.740
He's grown into a good boy.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:13.410
I'd like a chance to act
more like a dad sometimes.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:36.580
Hello!

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:41.370
"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation"

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:44.950
I'm fine now. The outside doesn't scare me.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:49.830
I have Roxy to thank for that.
I'll treasure her holy relic.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.660
Get out of the village, demon!

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.080
Go back to the Demon Continent!

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.200
Go away!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:01.990
Yeah!

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.540
Get lost, demon!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.410
Get lost!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.080
Whoa, not good. This is bullying.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.580
Stop it!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:23.700
What?!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.700
Bullying someone three-against-one?

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.120
You're the worst!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.450
Where are you looking?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.740
The knight's kid, huh? Butt out!

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.830
It doesn't matter if they don't hit me.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.870
Where'd he get water from?!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:43.830
This is lame.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.660
Let's go.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.830
Are you okay?

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.450
This is a surprise.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.330
He's shockingly handsome.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:01.830
I bet he'd make a <i>shotacon</i>
lady's heart skip a beat.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:05.370
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.240
Lean forward a bit.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.950
Huh? What?

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.120
I guess he mostly does what people tell him.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:16.410
I bet he'd make a <i>shotacon</i> dude's heart throb.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.120
Whoops!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.700
Close your eyes.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:22.740
Wash your clothes at home, okay?

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.830
There. Okay.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.990
Th-Thank you...

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.580
Never go near anyone

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:35.410
with emerald-green hair and what looks
like a red gem on their forehead!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.370
His forehead... is big and clear.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.620
Okay, safe.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.080
He's not a dangerous Superd.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.450
Wait, those ears...

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.580
You know,

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.700
kids like that won't stop unless you fight back.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.540
Y-You don't mind... how I look?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.740
My master was a demon.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.830
Are you one, too?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.330
I don't know.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:05.740
My dad says no.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:10.120
He doesn't know, huh?
I guess he wouldn't at his age.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:13.160
My dad is just half elf.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.830
Oh! I knew it!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.990
This world has elves, too.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:21.950
But my hair color's different
from my dad's and my mom's.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.370
Huh? Wh-What?

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:27.700
There, there.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:31.490
It sounds like his family
situation's complicated.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:36.040
Still, he gets mud thrown
at him just for his hair color?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.740
Just the idea almost makes me piss myself.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:41.830
Umm...

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.120
Why did you help me?

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:48.330
My father says to be a friend to the weak.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.160
But they might leave you out.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.660
If that happens, you play with me.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:54.540
Huh?

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:58.040
Starting today, we're friends.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.910
Oh, are you busy with chores or something?

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.370
N-No!

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.700
Lucky.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.870
With his looks, girls will
be all over him someday.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.450
A few might come my way if I stick with him.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.120
Come to think of it, I didn't ask your name.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.700
I'm Rudeus.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.540
And you?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:21.700
Sylph...

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:24.870
Sylph?

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:28.870
That's a nice name. Like a wind spirit.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.370
Yeah.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.620
Yahoo!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.160
What should we play?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:45.330
I don't know. I've never played with a friend.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:50.120
He must never have had any.
I feel sorry for him.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.580
Of course, neither did I.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:55.240
Teach me that thing from before.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.120
What?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.620
Where you wave your hand
and a splash of warm water

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:02.040
or a gust of warm wind shoots out.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.040
Oh, that.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.120
Can I do it, too?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.990
You can if you learn the incantations.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.330
I think.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.540
"Incantations"?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.490
Are you interested?

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.200
Yeah.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:24.950
Okay! I've got time, anyway.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.740
Let's practice!

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.120
I'm home now.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.240
Father?

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.870
Do you know why I'm upset?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.290
Why?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.830
Is it about Roxy's panties--I mean holy relic?

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:50.490
I-I don't know.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:52.490
I hear

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:56.040
you punched little Somal.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.990
It's not that this time.

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.450
Wait, what?

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:00.830
You mean today?

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.410
I do.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.240
Oh, I see.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:06.660
Must be the brat who was bullying Sylph.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.950
I don't know what you heard, Father, but--

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:09.790
No!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.870
When you do something bad, you say, "Sorry"!

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.370
I was walking when I heard voices, and--

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.790
No excuses!

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:20.490
Sounds like he won't even listen
to my side of it after that lie.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:21.790
What's that look for?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.410
I could just apologize for now,

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.200
but I don't think that would be best for Paul.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.660
Well? Why don't you say anything?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:32.790
Because you'll yell not to make excuses if I do.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:34.040
What?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:37.490
Shout and make your kid
apologize before he says anything?

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.160
I wish I could deal with
things as quickly as adults.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.660
Rudy!

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.040
Father,

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:53.330
until now, I've done my best to be a good child.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:55.290
That's beside the point.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:56.870
No, it isn't.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:00.450
I've worked hard to earn your trust.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:05.450
You shouted at me and hit me without
giving me any chance to explain myself.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.620
But little Somal was definitely hurt, and--

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:13.330
Even if his injury were my fault,
I wouldn't apologize.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.910
Hang on, what happened?

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:19.120
Didn't you say, "no excuses"?

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.700
Don't worry, Father.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:27.870
Next time I see three kids gang up
to bully one helpless kid, I'll ignore it.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.490
In fact, I'll join in and
make it four against one.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:34.990
I'll let everyone know that
that's the Greyrat family way.

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:39.790
Then, once I grow up, I'll leave
and never call myself Greyrat again.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:43.740
I'd be ashamed to be from a family like that.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.330
You'd better call it quits, Paul.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:54.040
I didn't spend 20 years weaseling my way
out of unwinnable arguments for nothing.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.740
And I'm completely in the right this time.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.040
You haven't got a chance.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.740
Sorry.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.620
I was wrong.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.290
Tell me.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.450
I'm home.

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:08.160
Welcome back, Rudy.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.330
Did you have fun today?

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.200
I made a new friend today.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.870
My! How nice.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.950
Can I invite them here next time?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.950
How'd it end up this way?

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:19.790
Your son hit my boy!

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:20.790
Somal did have a bruise from a punch.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.410
Look at this bruise!

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.950
Rudeus always acts so grown-up.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.080
His eye's swollen!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:27.160
I was almost relieved
he'd done something childish.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:26.120
What if it leaves lasting damage?!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.870
Hey! Are you listening to me?

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.450
However,

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:32.160
Rudeus is a saint-class water mage at his age.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.700
Aren't you going to apologize?!

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:36.910
I humbly apologize on behalf of my son.

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:36.910
I figured I had to be
a little extra hard on him.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.580
How'd it end up this way?

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:45.490
Who am I to say, "a man's strength
is for protecting the weak"?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:49.040
What's wrong? You look gloomy.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.330
Oh,

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.870
I had a little fight with Rudy.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.870
That's unusual.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:12:00.330
If I'd told him to get out,
he probably would have left this house.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.240
Just like that.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.580
Like you did?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.870
I never got to apologize to him,

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:13.120
but I wonder if my old man felt like this.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.160
It's summer again.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:22.120
Those brats never learned their
lesson and kept coming after me,

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.910
but I fought them off.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:27.080
And every time, that mother comes to complain.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:31.450
I think she's more interested
in Paul than in her kid.

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:34.330
She's using the kid as
an excuse to come see him.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:37.120
Ridiculous.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:40.620
But man, it's hot! Way too hot!

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.700
Sorry. Did you wait?

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.660
Nope! I just got here.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.620
As if.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.080
I did it!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.910
Sylph's mana has grown
a lot in the past six months.

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.660
I guess my hypothesis was right.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.080
You've gotten a lot better.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:02.950
That claim that mana is
limited is really untrustworthy.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.200
Next!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.950
Okay, okay. What should we do?

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:06.540
That one you did before that made a warm breeze!

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:07.830
Oh, that.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:12.160
For that one, you apply
water and fire like this.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:17.830
Why don't you say it out loud, Rudy?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.290
Oh, incantation-less casting?

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.790
I think it might be hard for you.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.160
Teach me to do it.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.490
Let me see...

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.410
Okay.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:40.620
You know how, when you say a spell,

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.660
you feel mana gathering in your fingertips?

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:44.830
Yeah.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:49.410
Remember the spell without saying it
and squeeze it out your fingertips.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.040
Try doing it like that.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.160
Start with an easy one.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.700
Yeah!

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:04.240
It's hard to teach something you do by feeling.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.490
Even Roxy couldn't do it.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.490
Maybe incantation-less
casting really is special.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.870
Actually, I hope it is.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.910
I got reincarnated in another world.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.370
Is a convenient skill or two
too much to ask for?

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.200
I did it!

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.660
I did it, Rudy!

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.240
I did it! I did it!

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.080
Sylph!

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.540
I did it! I did it!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.950
Sylph! Wait up!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.870
Sylph!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.580
He's gorgeous.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.620
Even as a man, I can feel that.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.580
Damn. I'm so jealous.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:03.160
Now I think of it, the old me had
a childhood friend who was a girl.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.830
I hear she got married a while ago.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.580
What a wasted opportunity.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:12.580
Current me can rub three out to
just the words "childhood friend."

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.200
Hurry up, Sylph!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.540
I'm home.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.290
Welcome home, Young Master.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.450
And... a friend.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.200
Hello.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.700
The bath is ready for you.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.580
Thank you very much.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.410
Sylph, over here.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.200
Okay.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.080
All right.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.290
What's wrong?

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.870
You'll get cold if you don't hurry up.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.740
O-Okay.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.120
Come on, raise your hands.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:56.370
O-Okay.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:16:00.790
Come on. You're old enough to do this yourself.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:13.790
What are you embarrassed for?
Take off your pants, too.

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:15.370
N-No.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.040
Come on, hurry up. You'll catch a cold.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.370
Stop.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.200
I know how you feel, Sylph.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:28.450
In my old life, I had a dick
that people would laugh at, too.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.660
I won't laugh at you.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:31.740
That's not...

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:32.990
N-No!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:36.200
Does it really look that weird?

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.990
What gives? It's not fair
if I'm the only one naked.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.660
All right, fine.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.410
But you have to change your clothes later.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.040
Okay.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:47.870
Or so I say!

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.700
Got you!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.120
The thing I witnessed in that instant

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.290
was not the pure short sword I've grown used to.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:09.450
Of course, it wasn't a dark blade
covered in sinister designs either.

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:13.290
What should have been there...
well, <i>wasn't</i> there,

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:14.660
What's wrong?!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.240
and what <i>was</i> there stunned me.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.910
In my old life, I fantasized
about it through my monitor

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:23.370
while making my black-lust whitey-cannon
to meet a paper handkerchief.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:23.370
Rudy, what are you doing?

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.910
There it was.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:28.290
He... was a she.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:36.410
Why would you do something like that?

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.200
I'm sorry.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.660
I won't fly off the handle.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:43.700
I won't make that mistake again.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.620
Tell me why you did it.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:50.620
We were all wet,
so I thought she'd catch a cold.

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.120
But she said "no," didn't she?

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.620
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:18:00.200
Well, you might be getting
interested in that stuff at your age,

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.290
but never force anyone.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.240
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.870
I'll never do it again.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:10.200
Apologize to Sylphiette, not me. Understand?

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:13.160
Sylph... iette?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.910
Will she forgive me?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.870
Oh, don't worry.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:23.450
If you apologize sincerely, she'll forgive you.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:30.330
I get feeling down when
the girl you like rejects you.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:34.200
Womanizing runs in the family.
You probably inherited it.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:37.160
Still, you're a smart boy, my son.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.700
You'll make good use of this failure.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.830
You make me hopeful and
worried at the same time.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.490
I'm sorry, Sylphiette!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:54.290
You have short hair, so I thought
you were a boy this whole time!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.910
Oh dear.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:08.290
My son may be dumber than I thought.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.370
Not your best effort.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:28.040
Are you still having trouble
making up with Sylphiette?

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.040
Yeah.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.580
My swordsmanship isn't going
well either. It makes me sigh.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.040
Want some advice from your dad?

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.040
Yes, please.

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:39.040
Hmm. I don't know...

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.620
Shall I lick your boots?

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.990
Listen, you...

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.580
Listen, Rudy.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:50.490
Women like men's strengths,
but they like our weaknesses, too.

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:51.830
Think about it.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:54.040
If someone clearly stronger than you

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.660
chased after you with naked lust,
how would you feel?

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:59.580
I guess... I'd be scared.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:00.620
Right?

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:02.990
So, show her your vulnerable side.

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:05.080
I see! But how?

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:10.040
Make a clean breast of your
worries in front of Sylphiette.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.580
Like, let her see you're
bothered that she's avoiding you.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:16.580
What do you think will happen then?

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:23.240
If you're lucky, she'll come to you.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.660
Wh-What if that doesn't work?

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:28.950
Ask me again. I'll tell you the next move.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:32.450
I-I see! Then, you've got backup plans.

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.660
That said,

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:34.990
go!

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:41.660
Get going!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.830
Rudy, about before...

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.490
What's wrong, Rudy?

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:57.620
I-I was just thinking that I haven't
seen your c-cuteness around l-lately.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.740
It's a real shame.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:04.830
Y-You're cute, Sylphie, so maybe
you should grow out your hair.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.830
Huh? I don't want to.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:17.330
You've been awfully cold lately.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:25.950
Sorry.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:30.830
But I don't hate you or anything, Rudy.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.370
Sylphie...

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:35.830
So, just act normal.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:39.330
A cute, young girl my own age.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:42.450
I don't know the right way
to get along with her.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:47.540
I am a man, so I'd like to build
a good relationship for the future.

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:52.240
She wants our relationship
to stay just how it's been.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.740
In that case, I'll act normally.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:00.790
I should do all I can to cherish
a friend I made in this new world.

00:21:56.580 --> 00:22:00.790
I'm glad you managed to make up!

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:08.990
Still, what am I teaching my son at his age?

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.990
Episode 3

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.990
A Friend

00:23:41.990 --> 00:23:46.980
Next time

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:46.980
Emergency Family Meeting
